---
/**
 * Root redirect → default locale (/de).
 *
 * Required by Astro i18n (`prefixDefaultLocale: true` demands a page at this
 * path) and satisfies the "redirect / to /de" requirement. In static output,
 * Astro emits a client-side redirect HTML; for a true 301 on Cloudflare Pages
 * we additionally keep `public/_redirects` (added in T8).
 */
return Astro.redirect('/de');
